<title>JAPAN: Myojo Foods - 95/96 group results.</title>
<headline>Myojo Foods - 95/96 group results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Group)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 75.77		vs	   67.70</p>
<p> Operating	prft 598 million	  vs   loss 642    million</p>
<p> Current	  prft 620 million	  vs   loss 700    million</p>
<p> Net		prft 100 million	  vs     loss 1.72</p>
<p> EPS	     prft 2.24 yen	  vs    loss 38.40 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Myojo Foods Co Ltd is a major maker of instant noodles.</p>
